## Rules

- Work phase-by-phase. Do not implement future phases.
- Do not invent product requirements, roles, fields, or V1 features.
- Do not modify locked architecture without explicit approval and a docs update.
- Label unknowns **OPEN DECISION**. Do not silently invent answers.
- V1 non-goals must not leak into design or code.
- Do not collapse profile status, verification status, and directory visibility into one status field.
- Do not treat member claims as verified credentials.
- Do not use insecure permanent secret profile URLs as long-term auth.
- Minimize dependencies. Preserve working behaviour once code exists.
- Report files changed. Report failures honestly. Do not claim PASS without meeting that phase’s acceptance criteria.

